(6194865, 914182, 83313, '<td valign="top">There is an absolute TON of jpeg compression in this image that is killing clarity and detail. Always save your challenge entries at the largest size/lowest compression level possible without going over the challenge limit. Your image is 16k in size, and the challenge limit is 300k. With some more detail visible, I think this would do a good amount better than it will. Hope that helps, but PM me if I can offer more explanation.</td>', 'There is an absolute TON of jpeg compression in this image that is killing clarity and detail. Always save your challenge entries at the largest size/lowest compression level possible without going over the challenge limit. Your image is 16k in size, and the challenge limit is 300k. With some more detail visible, I think this would do a good amount better than it will. Hope that helps, but PM me if I can offer more explanation.', '2010-10-18 14:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
