(6198288, 914326, 103142, '<td valign="top">I can see why someone thinks the run in the stocking is distracting -- it is -- yet it''s so perfect. It makes turns it from a regular (but nice) photograph into a great story. You and jbrobeson are right, however. The shoes should have been more worn. Not that it''s a problem in this photo -- but just because, if the shoes were worn and there was a run in the stockings, you probably would have had a picture that was an instant classic.<br/> <br/>beautifully done -- congrats on the ribbon!</td>', 'I can see why someone thinks the run in the stocking is distracting -- it is -- yet it''s so perfect. It makes turns it from a regular (but nice) photograph into a great story. You and jbrobeson are right, however. The shoes should have been more worn. Not that it''s a problem in this photo -- but just because, if the shoes were worn and there was a run in the stockings, you probably would have had a picture that was an instant classic. beautifully done -- congrats on the ribbon!', '2010-10-22 09:34:31.000000', NULL, 0),
