(6202503, 913636, 72929, '<td valign="top">A great photo that tells a good story, surprised it didn''t vote higher. I only have a couple critiques:<br/>-Awkward composition/cropped too tight<br/>-Would have liked to see the other leg in the frame<br/>-Dog in background is distracting<br/>-Skin tones too red</td>', 'A great photo that tells a good story, surprised it didn''t vote higher. I only have a couple critiques:-Awkward composition/cropped too tight-Would have liked to see the other leg in the frame-Dog in background is distracting-Skin tones too red', '2010-10-27 09:52:42.000000', NULL, 0),
